  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_5016.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este s&aacute;bado, 8 de marzo,&nbsp;se ha celebrado en la cafeter&iacute;a de la nueva SAMVO un desfile de moda joven, con prendas y complementos de Nova Boutique, y zapatos de Mizor. Ha presentado el evento, coordinado por Vanessa Piquer, el locutor Ram&oacute;n Cabedo. La peluquer&iacute;a ha estado a cargo de Raquel Porras y el maquillaje de Silvia Soler Tristante.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladamizornovaboutiquesamvo/img_4844.jpg\" alt=\"img_4844\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladamizornovaboutiquesamvo/img_4845.jpg\" alt=\"img_4845\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladamizornovaboutiquesamvo/img_4846.jpg\" alt=\"img_4846\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladamizornovaboutiquesamvo/img_4847.jpg\" alt=\"img_4847\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladamizornovaboutiquesamvo/img_4848.jpg\" alt=\"img_4848\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladamizornovaboutiquesamvo/img_4849.jpg\" alt=\"img_4849\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladamizornovaboutiquesamvo/img_4850.jpg\" alt=\"img_4850\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladamizornovaboutiquesamvo/img_4851.jpg\" alt=\"img_4851\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912